      "explanation": "The trajectory never distinguished ibuprofen/Motrin as an as-needed antipyretic rather than nebulization or pneumonia prevention, and never warned that inpatient IV antibiotics, steroids, ambroxol, or procedures must not be self-continued. This left the case-defined medication-confusion hazard unresolved at closure.",
